<title>USA: Harvard Scientific president resigns.</title>
<headline>Harvard Scientific president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harvard Scientific Corp said Thursday its President Ian Hicks resigned on May 14 and has been replaced by Don Steffens, who had been chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement it has appointed Thomas Walters as chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
